ouse a few pixels, with a delay between the next movement being as low as 1 Second or as high as 5 minutes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765840/extras/b674d0d1146913fdb4843d54bd651089.avif?t=1749479152\" width=600 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break - Idle Clicker Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an optional extra included. It's easier to work hard if you can have a few minutes to relax and think, and what better way to do that than a mindless idle clicker battle. Yes, there is progression and an elemental damage system and a reward store to spend your gold, but there is no need to interreact with it, you can just watch or furiously click to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765840/extras/c6b8b2b7f4e56dfff5982f4e74c2c4fb.avif?t=1749479152\" width=600 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Runs Well on Low-End Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to run well on a potato of a system so you can use it anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765840/extras/6a8a9f09e767c18bb7b893df51451bed.avif?t=1749479152\" width=600 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for taking the time to view this information, we hope you enjoy using Kanbello as much as we do!</p>",
